    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that 30% of Mediterranean wet season precipitation variability is explained by large-scale atmospheric circulation, revealing that long-term trends since the mid-19th century, including a recent downward trend, are primarily governed by the North Atlantic Oscillation.",
